activity Detect Fraudulent Activity
activity Verify Customer Identity
activity Review Transaction Details
activity Approve Transaction
activity Decline Transaction
activity Report Suspicious Activity
activity Update Account Security
activity Notify Customer
activity Investigate Security Breach
activity Implement Security Patch
bind Detect Fraudulent Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount, Fraud Risk Level
bind Verify Customer Identity: Verification Attempts, Verification Status
bind Review Transaction Details: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Approve Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Decline Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Report Suspicious Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Update Account Security: Days Since Last Activity
bind Notify Customer: Customer Notification Method
bind Investigate Security Breach: Breach Severity
bind Implement Security Patch: Security Patch Status
Transaction Type: Debit, Credit, Wire Transfer, Online Payment
Transaction Amount: float between 0.01 and 100000.0
Fraud Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Verification Attempts: integer between 1 and 5
Verification Status: Verified, Not Verified, Pending
Breach Severity: integer between 1 and 10
Security Patch Status: Applied, Not Applied, Scheduled
Customer Notification Method: Email, SMS, Phone Call
Days Since Last Activity: integer between 0 and 365
Init[Detect Fraudulent Activity] | |
End[Notify Customer] | |
Existence[Verify Customer Identity] | |
Existence[Review Transaction Details] | |
Absence2[Implement Security Patch] | |
Exactly[Investigate Security Breach] | |
Responded Existence[Report Suspicious Activity, Investigate Security Breach] | | |
Precedence[Approve Transaction, Verify Customer Identity] | |T.Verification Status is Verified |
Precedence[Decline Transaction, Detect Fraudulent Activity] | |T.Fraud Risk Level is High |
Response[Detect Fraudulent Activity, Review Transaction Details] |A.Fraud Risk Level is High | |
Response[Report Suspicious Activity, Notify Customer] | |T.Customer Notification Method is Email |
Succession[Verify Customer Identity, Decline Transaction] |A.Verification Status is Not Verified | |
Alternate Response[Investigate Security Breach, Implement Security Patch] | |T.Security Patch Status is Applied |
Alternate Precedence[Implement Security Patch, Investigate Security Breach] | | |
Chain Response[Decline Transaction, Notify Customer] | |T.Customer Notification Method is SMS |
Chain Precedence[Update Account Security, Investigate Security Breach] | |T.Breach Severity > 7 |
Co-Existence[Report Suspicious Activity, Update Account Security] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Approve Transaction, Decline Transaction] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Approve Transaction, Decline Transaction] | |A.Transaction Amount == T.Transaction Amount |
Not Responded Existence[Approve Transaction, Report Suspicious Activity] | | |
Not Precedence[Notify Customer, Detect Fraudulent Activity] | | |
Not Response[Approve Transaction, Decline Transaction] | |A.Transaction Amount == T.Transaction Amount |
Not Chain Succession[Approve Transaction, Decline Transaction] | | |